This product includes aggregate statistics derived from third-party datasets.

The data-driven router's tool table (web_router/data/data_driven/tool_table.json)
holds counts of labelled requests. Part of those requests come from
Mind2Web-Live by iMean AI
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/iMeanAI/Mind2Web-Live), licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The requests were relabelled by
method and reduced to counts; no text of the dataset is included.

The other sources of that table, with their licences, are listed at
https://docs.webrouter.net/smart-routing#trained-on and in
web_router/data/data_driven/manifest.json.
